  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_SharesWithFullVotingRightsTreasurySharesEtcMember" xsi:nil="true"/>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_SharesWithFullVotingRightsOtherMember">権利内容に何ら限定のない当社における標準となる株式</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_SharesLessThanOneUnitMember">１単元（100株）未満の株式であります。</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
